{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"reuseIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"reuseIdentifier","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A unique string identifier for this view that allows you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to reuse this view with multiple similar annotations. You can set this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if you don’t intend to reuse the view, but it is a good","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"idea in general to specify a reuse identifier to avoid creating redundant","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"views.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The initialized annotation view object."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The reuse identifier provides a way for you to improve performance by recycling","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotation views as they enter and leave the map’s viewport. As an annotation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves the viewport, the map view moves its associated view to a reuse queue.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"When a new annotation becomes visible, you can request a view for that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"annotation by passing the appropriate reuse identifier string to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNAnnotationView.h#L77","fileName":"MLNAnnotationView.h"},"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNAnnotationView(im)initWithReuseIdentifier:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializes and returns a new annotation view object."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/initWithReuseIdentifier:"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/initwithreuseidentifier:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNAnnotation","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","title":"MLNAnnotation","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationView/initWithReuseIdentifier:":{"title":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithReuseIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView\/initWithReuseIdentifier:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview\/initwithreuseidentifier:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Initializes and returns a new annotation view object."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationView":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNAnnotationView","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MLNAnnotationView","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" class is responsible for marking a point annotation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a view. Annotation views represent an annotation object, which is an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object that corresponds to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" protocol. When an annotation’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"geographic coordinate is visible in the map view, the map view asks its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegate to a corresponding annotation view. If an annotation view is created","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a reuse identifier, the map view may recycle the view when it goes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offscreen.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationView","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationview"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/dequeuereusableannotationviewwithidentifier:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","title":"dequeueReusableAnnotationViewWithIdentifier:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a reusable annotation view object associated with its identifier."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}